00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:25,000
This independent candidate demonstration helps support engineers trace findings to evidence.

2
00:00:25,000 --> 00:01:10,000
Reconnect banners and missing templates require investigation of both control and audio connections. A speed test does not establish persistent connection health.

3
00:01:10,000 --> 00:02:05,000
The supplied excerpt has nine lines: three audio timeouts, one control reconnect pair, a duplicate socket, two checks and one call start. Root cause remains unconfirmed.

4
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:50,000
Use the local parser to classify recognized events and review their source lines. The demonstration is deterministic; no Balto API or live model is connected.

5
00:02:50,000 --> 00:03:35,000
Collect approved network comparisons, client logs and socket close reasons. Change one variable at a time and preserve rollback.

6
00:03:35,000 --> 00:04:00,000
Verify template visibility, stable audio, expected recordings and customer confirmation. No resolution or customer outcome has been claimed.
